          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装未报告错误，但磁盘上的 %@ 仍为 %@ — 下载的内容并非 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The latest version no longer supports this Mac — click for details": {
